License notices for glab, the GitLab CLI, as installed in this image

glab is installed from GitLab's release .deb, which carries no license text.
This directory supplies the notices that package omits:

  copyright     glab's own license: LICENSE of gitlab.com/gitlab-org/cli v1.111.0
  CREDITS       credits a compiled-in component's license requires
  third-party/  the license and notice files of every Go module compiled into
                /usr/bin/glab, and of the Go standard library, one directory
                per module: golang/<module>@<version>/
  notices.json  the files that cover each component, where each was taken
                from, and its SHA-256

Every file other than this README and CREDITS is the unmodified upstream file.
